<title>PHILIPPINES: Urban sets div record date Sept 20.</title>
<headline>Urban sets div record date Sept 20.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Urban Bank Inc said on Friday it had set the record date for its 15 percent stock dividend on September 20.</p>
<p>The dividend was declared by its board of directors last February 27.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
